OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust when did the version of the BBC's
OL,7,Fcorporate logo used in the late-80s and
OL,8,F90s get unveiled?
OL,10,FThe corporate logo appears in a festive
OL,11,Fpromo for BBC Records/Books/Videos,
OL,12,Ftransmitted on BBC Two on 29th November
OL,13,F1987.
OL,15,FIt also appears in an inset graphic in
OL,16,Fan edition of the Nine o'Clock News
OL,17,Ffrom 9th December 1987 (available on
OL,18,FYouTube).
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768767025
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe understand the logo also appeared in
OL,7,Fthe 3rd December edition of the Nine
OL,8,Fo'Clock News.
OL,10,FThe new logo also featured in a See for
OL,11,FYourself supplement in the 2nd ` 8th
OL,12,FJanuary 1988 issue of the Radio Times.
OL,14,FThe introduction of this version of the
OL,15,Flogo was gradual.
OL,17,FIt was the latest evolution of the BBC
OL,18,Fboxes first seen in the late-50s.
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13403
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768767025
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut from the mid-70s on, the corporate
OL,7,Flogo was used less and less on screen `
OL,8,Fit was notably withdrawn from the BBC
OL,9,FOne idents in 1974 and from generic
OL,10,Fnews bulletins in 1976.
OL,12,FAfter about 1982 it was rarely seen
OL,13,Fexcept in the copyright tag on end
OL,14,Fcredits.
OL,16,FThe corporate logo, by stealth, came to
OL,17,Fbe seen purely as the logo of the
OL,18,Fcorporation itself ` not as part of the
OL,19,Fbranding for its services.
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13404
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768767025
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to invest in a new logo in
OL,7,F1987 was an interesting one. It came at
OL,8,Fa time when the BBC was under fire and
OL,9,Fneeded to reassert itself and regain
OL,10,Fits confidence.
OL,12,FWas it commissioned after Michael
OL,13,FCheckland took over as director-general
OL,14,Fin 1987? Or under his predecessor
OL,15,FAlastair Milne who was sacked in
OL,16,Fcontroversial circumstances?
OL,18,FMore intriguingly, was there always a
OL,19,Flong-term plan to use it on screen
OL,20,Fagain? Or was it initially just meant
OL,21,Fto represent the corporation itself?
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13405
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768767025
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt this time it's worth noting it was
OL,7,Fnot uncommon for individual programmes
OL,8,Fto have their own headed notepaper with
OL,9,Fno corporate branding.
OL,11,FThe first meaningful on-screen use came
OL,12,Fwith the introduction of the BBC Sport
OL,13,Fanimation at the time of the Seoul
OL,14,FOlympics.
OL,16,FSome regional news programmes also
OL,17,Fstarted to use the new logo.
OL,19,FBut there was clearly no rush to push
OL,20,Fthe logo onto screens.
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13406
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768767025
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new look Nine o'Clock News launched
OL,7,Fa few weeks after the Olympics ` with
OL,8,Fbold graphics from Lambie-Nairn ` had
OL,9,Fno sign of it but it would have been
OL,10,Feasy enough to add it on.
OL,12,FBBC Breakfast News launched with a
OL,13,Fgraphic forming the letters BBC with no
OL,14,Frelation whatsoever to the corporate
OL,15,Flogo.
OL,17,FIt took until 1993 for the BBC News to
OL,18,Fbe rebranded and consistently use the
OL,19,Fcorporate logo though it started
OL,20,Fcreeping in about two years before.
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
