OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCopyright tags started using it as
OL,7,Fstandard on 1st January 1990.
OL,9,FAnd presentation, of course, started
OL,10,Fusing the corporate logo with the
OL,11,FFebruary 1991 rebrand.
OL,13,FSo was there always a long-term plan to
OL,14,Fuse the logo prominently? Or did it
OL,15,Fhappen by stealth as branding became
OL,16,Fmore important with the start of
OL,17,Fmultichannel TV?
OL,19,FIt would be interesting to know.
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
